      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name means Saint Patrick, honoring the patron saint of Ireland, reflecting its Irish settlers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Patricio%2C_Texas",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1836, the Battle of San Patricio fought near the town was part of the Texas Revolution.",
