      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Patricio%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "William O'Docharty served as the first alcalde, with aldermen including Thomas Adams and Francisco De León.",
